      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðon ðe oþres mannes man underfehþ.] [Ld] ⁊ ne underfó nan mon oþres monnes mon, buton his leafe þe he ær folgode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no man shall receive a man who is subject to another, without the permission of him whom he has been serving.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be ðon ðe oþres mannes man underfehþ. Ne underfó nan man oþres mannes man, butan ðæs leafe ðe he ær folgode.</ab>
      </div>
